---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../data/site";
---

<Layout title="About">

<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">

<a href="/" class="inline-block mb-8 text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-white transition">
  ← Home
</a>

<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">
About
</h1>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-400">
{SITE.tagline}
</p>

<article class="prose prose-invert mt-10">

<h2>Why this Lab exists</h2>

<p>
Alok Engineering Lab is a personal space for building systems, exploring technology,
documenting experiments, and preserving what is learned along the way.
</p>

<h2>What lives here</h2>

<p>
Projects, technical writing, engineering notes, experiments, documentation,
and milestones from the journey.
</p>

<h2>Engineering philosophy</h2>

<p>
Build deliberately. Test what matters. Document decisions. Learn from failures.
Keep useful knowledge connected and easy to revisit.
</p>

</article>

</main>

</Layout>
